	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES:\n2.1.2 Internal LNA mode configuration\nu-blox 10 receivers support three modes for the internal low-noise amplifier (LNA): normal gain, low\ngain, and bypass mode. The MAX-M10S default is the low-gain mode. With a high-gain external\nactive antenna, the bypass mode can be used. The normal-gain mode is not recommended for MAXM10S.\n\nThe internal LNA mode can be configured at run time in BBR and RAM memory using the\nconfiguration item CFG-HW-RF_LNA_MODE and applying a software reset by sending UBX-CFGRST message. Refer to Forcing receiver reset for more information."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 121.285 0)
		(size 53.34 72.39)
		(margins 1.8 1.8 1.8 1.8)
		(stroke
			(width 0.6)
